stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Healthy: Key Registered

    Healthy --> Healthy: 200 OK (report_success)
    Healthy --> RateLimited: HTTP 429 / RPM exhausted
    Healthy --> Exhausted: RPD daily limit reached
    Healthy --> Invalid: HTTP 401 / 403
    Healthy --> Disabled: User disables key

    RateLimited --> Healthy: 60s cooldown expires
    RateLimited --> Exhausted: RPD limit hit during cooldown check

    Exhausted --> Healthy: Midnight UTC daily reset

    Invalid --> Healthy: User re-validates key
    Invalid --> Disabled: User acknowledges

    Disabled --> Healthy: User re-enables key
